The dart demo: a pub workspace that melos 7 drives, whose Flutter app apps/mobile depends on packages/pricing and packages/ui through path dependencies. The change adds a discount to pricing and bumps intl in the root pubspec.lock. The files are hand-written in the shapes Flutter 3.29 and pub write: melos exec -- "flutter test --machine --coverage | tojunit --output test-results.xml" wrote each package's test-results.xml and coverage/lcov.info on a GitHub runner, and pubspec.lock carries placeholder hashes; the CycloneDX SBOMs state the licences pub.dev gives.
-- base/pubspec.yaml --
name: shop_workspace
publish_to: none

environment:
  sdk: ^3.7.0

workspace:
  - apps/mobile
  - packages/pricing
  - packages/ui

# melos 7, activated globally, reads its configuration here.
melos:
  scripts:
    test:
      run: melos exec --dir-exists=test -- "flutter test --machine --coverage | tojunit --output test-results.xml"
      description: Run the tests of each package with coverage and a JUnit report.
-- base/pubspec.lock --
